  "question": {
    "text": "The amount of electricity in Coulomb required for the oxidation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo> </mo><mi>mol</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is ______ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>.</mo></math>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>→</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math></p><p>Electricity required to oxidise <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>mol <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo> </mo><mtext>to</mtext><mo> </mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>96500</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>mole <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math>-factor <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>96500</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>96500</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>96500</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>93</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p>"
